gxp 2

given
  a = 1.2
  point A
  p1 = parabola(A)
    a1: a(p1) = a

construct
  point B on p1
  segment AB
    θ1: angle(xaxis, AB) = 50°

find
  d1: dist(A, B)

where
  A (-2.1898116585004335, 0.9861608851745279)
  p1 a 1.2 angle 0° [fixed angle]
  B (1.1898116585004341, 5.013839114825473)
  a1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  θ1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
